<title>USA: August U.S. primary aluminum output up from July.</title>
<headline>August U.S. primary aluminum output up from July.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average daily rate of U.S. primary aluminum production rose to 9,756 tonnes in August from 9,725 tonnes in July and 9,235 tonnes in August 1995, Aluminum Association reported.</p>
<p>The annual rate of primary aluminum production totaled 3,570,720 tonnes in August, up from 3,559,503 tonnes in July and 3,370,716 tonnes in August 1995.</p>
<p>Actual production in 1995 was 3,375,241 tonnes.</p>
<p>--New York Commodities 212-859-1646</p>
</text>
